      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Constitutional Articles Related to State Government outline the legal powers and provisions of state governance.",
        "The Governor, Chief Minister, and Council of Ministers form the executive machinery of the state.",
        "The State Legislature comprises the Legislative Assembly (Vidhan Sabha) and Legislative Council (Vidhan Parishad).",
        "Key topics are essential for SSC and Indian competitive examinations focusing on Indian Polity."
